{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://ebmr.internal/contracts/events/event-erp-001.json",
  "title": "SPEC-ERP-001..006 — Enterprise ERP Integration Events",
  "description": "WP-07 has no entries in 07_EVENT_CATALOGUE.yaml -- events derived directly from app/modules/erp/commands.py's actual event_type= producer code (the single consolidated module for Documents 48-53 per ADR-0009). 20 events found across two groups: master-data/instance lifecycle (Document 52, SPEC-ERP-005 master data sync) -- ERPInstanceRegistered, ERPInstanceValidated, MasterMappingProposed, MasterMappingActivated, MasterMappingSuspended, MasterConflictResolved, SyncCheckpointAdvanced -- and integration command reliability (Document 53, SPEC-ERP-006) -- ERPCommandQueued, ERPCommandRetried, ERPCommandCancelled, ExternalCommitNotFound, IntegrationCompensationQueued, ERPInboundEventReceived, ReconciliationStarted, ReconciliationMismatchDetected, ReconciliationResolved, ReconciliationCompleted, BulkJobStarted, BulkJobProgressRecorded, BulkJobCompleted, MigrationPackageRecorded. Two internal security-event strings (IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED, INBOUND_EVENT_ID_REUSED) write to a separate IntegrationSecurityEvent table via a distinct durably-committed-outside-the-caller's-transaction helper (INT-FR-025), not the outbox -- not included here, same treatment as security.audit-adjacent trails elsewhere in this codebase.",
  "x-requirement-ids": [
    "INT-FR-001",
    "INT-FR-003",
    "INT-FR-006",
    "INT-FR-007",
    "INT-FR-008",
    "INT-FR-010",
    "INT-FR-011",
    "INT-FR-013",
    "INT-FR-014",
    "INT-FR-015",
    "INT-FR-016",
    "INT-FR-017",
